@format 1
@id media-preview.in-merge
@title In Merge
@section Media preview
@area In Merge
@entry merge-path-change, merge-group-row
@summary Show the two Merge-specific selection paths that request a source in the preview viewer.
@related media-selection.common.files-selection, media-preview.common.viewer-gate, media-loading.in-merge
@tag media
@tag preview
@tag merge

@alias merge = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PMergeTab
@alias group = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PGroup

[merge-path-change] Merge Files current-path event <input>
~ This starts when the selected file changes in the Merge tab.
[Technical explanation]
= PListPathChange delivered the current path to PMergePathShow.
> merge-path-result

[merge-group-row] Merge grouped-item selection <input>
~ This starts with merge grouped-item selection.
[Technical explanation]
- Emit the selected grouped media path and forward it through PMergePathShow @ group.PGroupFileBuild(...)
  @ merge.PMergePathShow(...)
> map:media-preview.common.viewer-gate

[merge-path-result] Merge selected-path adapter <decision>
~ The Merge tab decides whether the selected file should be opened in the preview.
[Technical explanation]
- Ignore blank paths; otherwise request the Merge viewer source @ merge.PMergePathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:media-preview.common.viewer-gate
? "Blank current path" > merge-no-request

[merge-no-request] Merge preview request omitted <output>
~ This path ends with merge preview request omitted.
[Technical explanation]
= Merge does not call the shared viewer-preview pipeline for a blank path.
